Everybody poops in holes

00:00:17.560 --> 00:00:20.480
Some covered by porcelain thrones

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:24.640
Some are nothing but dirt and stones

00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:29.440
Some seats are heated

00:00:30.280 --> 00:00:33.320
Some seats are gold-plated, sanitized and treated

00:00:33.480 --> 00:00:36.280
Some don’t have seats, you just gotta squat

00:00:36.780 --> 00:00:38.720
That’s just what you got

00:00:38.720 --> 00:00:40.640
Everybody poops

00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:42.340
Everybody poops

00:00:42.340 --> 00:00:44.700
From kings in their marble rooms

00:00:44.700 --> 00:00:47.600
To kids in their light-up shoes

00:00:47.600 --> 00:00:49.860
No matter what you own

00:00:50.240 --> 00:00:51.360
You’re still alone

00:00:51.360 --> 00:00:55.840
When nature calls the truth

00:00:55.840 --> 00:01:00.640
Everybody poops

00:01:00.640 --> 00:01:03.880
Not everybody uses toilet paper wipes

00:01:03.880 --> 00:01:05.140
Some use water jets

00:01:05.220 --> 00:01:06.180
Others use rocks

00:01:06.180 --> 00:01:08.420
Some just improvise

00:01:08.420 --> 00:01:09.600
Some are terrible

00:01:10.140 --> 00:01:11.200
Some are easy

00:01:11.200 --> 00:01:12.540
Some are splashy

00:01:12.540 --> 00:01:13.500
Some are breezy

00:01:13.500 --> 00:01:14.980
Some take time

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:16.480
Some won’t stop

00:01:16.480 --> 00:01:18.920
Some you pray just drop

00:01:18.920 --> 00:01:20.240
Everybody poops

00:01:20.540 --> 00:01:22.080
Everybody poops

00:01:22.080 --> 00:01:25.260
From penthouse views to camping loops

00:01:25.260 --> 00:01:28.120
From fancy spa to forest roots

00:01:28.120 --> 00:01:29.760
No matter what you prove

00:01:29.860 --> 00:01:31.640
No matter what you choose

00:01:31.640 --> 00:01:35.980
We all pay nature’s dues

00:01:37.320 --> 00:01:39.420
Everybody poops

00:01:39.420 --> 00:01:43.560
It doesn’t care who you are

00:01:43.560 --> 00:01:46.120
It doesn’t care what you make

00:01:46.120 --> 00:01:49.580
It doesn’t care about your car

00:01:49.580 --> 00:01:52.840
Or the promises you break

00:01:54.360 --> 00:01:57.860
When the moment comes

00:01:57.860 --> 00:02:02.440
There’s no escape

00:02:06.960 --> 00:02:08.880
Everybody poops

00:02:08.940 --> 00:02:10.540
Everybody poops

00:02:10.540 --> 00:02:13.860
